# Frontend — CA Marketplace

Next.js 14 (App Router) in **`frontend/`**. TypeScript, Tailwind, React Query, Zustand, React Hook Form + Zod, Axios.

## Structure

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `src/app/` | App Router: layout, (auth)/login, terms, (ca)/*, (client)/*, search, ca/public/[caId] |
| `src/lib/api.ts` | Axios instance; baseURL from `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL`; Bearer + 401 refresh → retry once then redirect to /login |
| `src/lib/auth-store.ts` | Zustand store: user, tokens, logout, refresh token in localStorage |
| `src/lib/auth.ts` | setAuthFromLogin, loginWithGoogle, logout |
| `src/lib/errors.ts` | getApiErrorMessage(error) — parse error.code, error.message, 422 detail |
| `src/types/` | UserRole, VerificationStatus, BookingStatus, User, Tokens, ApiErrorBody, etc. |
| `src/hooks/useAuth.ts` | useAuth, useRequireAuth, useRequireRole(allowedRoles) |
| `src/app/providers.tsx` | QueryClientProvider |
| `src/lib/firebase.ts` | Firebase app init, getFirebaseAuth() (client-only) |

## Auth & API

- Login: Firebase Auth (Google sign-in) with role (CA | USER); send Google id_token to `POST /auth/google`. If terms not accepted → `/terms?role=…`; else redirect by role.
- Terms: `GET /terms/{role}`, `GET /terms/status`, `POST /terms/accept`. Wrap useSearchParams in Suspense.
- API: All requests get `Authorization: Bearer <access_token>`. On 401: POST /auth/refresh with refresh_token, retry once; on failure clear storage and redirect to /login.

## Routing & guards

- **CA:** `/ca/*` — layout checks auth + role; redirect to /login or /client if not CA.
- **USER:** `/client/*` — layout checks auth + role; redirect to /login or /ca/dashboard if not USER.
- Public: `/`, `/search`, `/ca/public/[caId]`.

## Conventions

- Use `getApiErrorMessage(error)` for user-facing API errors (login, terms, search, dashboard, bookings, etc.).
- Env: `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL` (e.g. http://localhost:8001), `NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_*` (Firebase config), `NEXT_PUBLIC_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID`. See `frontend/.env.local.example`.
- React Query for server state; Zustand for auth. Forms: react-hook-form + zod + @hookform/resolvers.
